      "source": [
        "# Group 8 — SMS Spam Detection\n",
        "## Integrated Experiment: TF-IDF + Logistic Regression and Sentence-BERT + Logistic Regression\n",
        "\n",
        "**Course:** Natural Language Processing · **Section:** FA02 · **Group:** 8  \n",
        "**Members:** Raneem Bahobail (2240002294) · Alaa Bughararah (2240005619)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "**Workstream attribution**\n",
        "- **Raneem:** UCI data loading, data checks, duplicate-aware splitting, TF-IDF feature extraction, Logistic Regression, and TF-IDF threshold selection.\n",
        "- **Alaa:** Frozen Sentence-BERT encoder, Logistic Regression on sentence embeddings, SBERT threshold selection, and the comparative evaluation/visualizations.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "4784080a",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "4784080a"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 0. Setup — Experiment Settings\n",
        "\n",
        "The agreed threshold-selection rule is: **minimize False Positive Rate (FPR) on the development set, subject to Spam Recall being at least `MIN_SPAM_RECALL`**. Each model gets its own threshold, selected independently from its own development probabilities. The test set is used only after thresholds are frozen.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "id": "632606e1",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "632606e1",
        "outputId": "af98b80b-ac6a-49ec-bec8-c36f94953033"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Minimum development Spam Recall: 0.9\n",
            "Candidate challenge keywords: ['free', 'win', 'urgent', 'cash', 'offer', 'reply']\n",
            "Challenge keywords confirmed: True\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "MIN_SPAM_RECALL = 0.90\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "SPAM_ASSOCIATED_KEYWORDS = [\"free\", \"win\", \"urgent\", \"cash\",\"offer\",\"reply\"]\n",
        "CHALLENGE_KEYWORDS_CONFIRMED = True\n",
        "\n",
        "RANDOM_STATE = 42\n",
        "TEST_SIZE = 0.20\n",
        "DEV_SIZE_OF_REMAINDER = 0.20\n",
        "DEFAULT_THRESHOLD = 0.50\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Minimum development Spam Recall:\", MIN_SPAM_RECALL)\n",
        "print(\"Candidate challenge keywords:\", SPAM_ASSOCIATED_KEYWORDS)\n",
        "print(\"Challenge keywords confirmed:\", CHALLENGE_KEYWORDS_CONFIRMED)"
      ]
    },
